1
00:00:00,548 --> 00:00:06,178
(Sheldon:)...that spot at the moment I first sat on it
would be zero, zero, zero, zero.

2
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,560
(Penny:)What?

3
00:00:11,393 --> 00:00:14,143
(Leonard:)Don't sit in his spot.

4
00:00:14,562 --> 00:00:15,602
[EXHALES SHARPLY]

5
00:00:15,772 --> 00:00:18,362
Fine. Happy?

6
00:00:18,525 --> 00:00:20,905
(Sheldon:)I'm not unhappy.

7
00:00:24,364 --> 00:00:28,364
(Penny:)Boy, I love him,
but he is one serious whackadoodle.

8
00:00:28,535 --> 00:00:29,705
(Leonard:)Okay, that should do it.

9
00:00:29,869 --> 00:00:32,539
(Penny:)Oh, thank you. You are a lifesaver.

10
00:00:32,705 --> 00:00:34,665
(Leonard:)That's a lot of shoes you ordered.

11
00:00:34,833 --> 00:00:38,293
(Penny:)Yeah, you know the sad thing is,
it's really not.

12
00:00:40,338 --> 00:00:42,678
(Penny:)Ooh, is this one of those paintball guns?

13
00:00:42,841 --> 00:00:44,551
You ought to come with us sometime.

14
00:00:44,717 --> 00:00:46,507
(Penny:)Oh, no, thanks. I'm from Nebraska.

15
00:00:46,678 --> 00:00:48,558
(Penny:)When we shoot things,
we wanna eat them...

16
00:00:48,721 --> 00:00:51,011
(Penny:)...or make them leave
our boyfriends alone. Ha, ha.

17
00:00:51,975 --> 00:00:53,305
[PAINTBALLS FIRE]

18
00:00:53,476 --> 00:01:09,026
PENNY:
Oh.

